CHECK:UNNECESSARY_PARENTHESES: Unnecessary parentheses around 'fmt->fmt != HDMI_I2S'
#195: FILE: drivers/gpu/drm/bridge/dw-hdmi-i2s-audio.c:44:
+	if ((fmt->fmt != HDMI_I2S) ||
+	    (fmt->bit_clk_master | fmt->frame_clk_master)) {

Parentheses are not required in the following cases:

  1. Function pointer uses::

      (foo->bar)();

    could be::

      foo->bar();

  2. Comparisons in if::

      if ((foo->bar) && (foo->baz))
      if ((foo == bar))

    could be::

      if (foo->bar && foo->baz)
      if (foo == bar)

  3. addressof/dereference single Lvalues::

      &(foo->bar)
      *(foo->bar)

    could be::

      &foo->bar
      *foo->bar

